"default":"<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Arthritis</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBT8e6mdxm_text","label":"ggBT8e6mdxm_text","default":"<p>Deep joint/groin pain</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFbtj7XPFV_text","label":"ggFbtj7XPFV_text","default":"<p>Worst after&nbsp;<br>getting up after sitting</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrj2BuzB63_text","label":"ggrj2BuzB63_text","default":"<p>Men and women&nbsp;</p><p>equally, usually 60+</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsZkAs3w1m_text","label":"ggsZkAs3w1m_text","default":"<p>Often can’t cross your legs, &nbsp;the hip just won’t move that way.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggINWXTVeY-_text","label":"ggINWXTVeY-_text","default":"<p>💬 Sound familiar?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_cSgY_aOy_text","label":"gg_cSgY_aOy_text","default":"<p>If so, you’re not imagining it—and you’re not alone. Traditional arthritis treatments may soothe symptoms, but they won’t heal the hormone‑linked tendon damage at the root of your nightly agony.</p>"}],
